{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  snippets/ak-notebook-archive.liquid
  ARCHIVE — NOTEBOOK CONVERSION (Stage ARCH-1, paper-only)
  (experiment theme 186464731416 only — DO NOT PUBLISH)

  The SEVENTH notebook page (after Products, Life/Style, Club Hub,
  Narrative, Bad Music /pages/2025, Bad Music /pages/badmusic-2025).
  Converts the main Archive route /collections (templates/
  list-collections.json) to the notebook-paper system using the
  accepted "dark media ON the paper" direction — the cassette-case
  folder-deck (sections/ak-archive.liquid) stays a DARK object laid on
  the yellow legal-pad paper (the Life/Style / Bad Music precedent, NOT
  a deck reskin). Paper backdrop + ink nav + Due Date footer CTA only.

  - Rendered from ONE NEW custom-liquid host section added to
    templates/list-collections.json (there was NO spare/disabled slot to
    repurpose — list-collections.json had zero custom-liquid sections).
    The host is placed in `order` right AFTER ak-top and BEFORE ak-archive
    so the class + paper render EARLY -> no flash of the dark deck. It is
    guarded by a LIQUID ROUTE GUARD: {% raw %}{% if template contains 'list-collections' %}{% endraw %}
    (no page.handle on a collections-list route — `template` is the house
    guard for non-page routes).
  - Adds .ak-archive-page to <html> via the standard one-line classList
    hook (the established pattern; the ONLY JS here).
  - Paints the accepted legal-pad paper scoped to .ak-archive-page.
    The deck declares its own opaque #000 on TWO elements — the section
    wrapper (.ak-archive-section, from the section schema "class") and the
    inner full-viewport stage (.ak-archive). Both are forced transparent
    (PAINT-ONLY — .ak-archive keeps its height:100vh / overflow:hidden /
    flex layout) so the paper shows behind the cassette fan. #MainContent/
    .gradient/.shopify-section/.ak-top-wrap are forced transparent too so
    the paper shows through the page chrome (incl. the mobile top band).
  - The inert particle canvas (.ak-archive-canvas#AkArchiveCanvas, already
    guard-disabled in the section JS: `if(!cv||prm||true) return;`) is
    hidden page-scoped (display:none). The element stays in the DOM, so the
    section's getElementById still resolves and the early-return path is
    unchanged — deck drag/tap/arrows/keyboard/layout are untouched.
  - Ports the accepted mask-PNG nav + ink header/cart (Club Hub Phase 3.9
    lineage, via the Products/Narrative/Bad Music port) re-scoped to
    .ak-archive-page. ARCHIVE (.ak-top-archive, the active tile on this
    route) is a MASKED wordmark tile: its ::before reads ink at rest and,
    being .is-active, the shared .ak-top-tile.is-active::before rule paints
    it official purple #ff33ff + magenta glow (the exact proven mechanism
    by which NARRATIVE renders active on /pages/narrative).
  - Footer CTA adopts Due Date (the accepted footer-font lane; no '#' in
    the CTA -> no Tenada). Shared ak-footer; ak-footer.liquid is NOT edited.
  - Archive arrows (.ak-archive-prev/.ak-archive-next) now sit in the paper
    gutters: PAINT-ONLY ink-tinted dark chips (so the white chevron keeps
    high contrast on yellow in rest AND hover, vs the base near-transparent
    hover that would wash out on paper), purple hover border. Geometry
    (position/size/z-index/transform) is NOT touched.
  - Cassette cards stay DARK (.ak-archive-card-inner is already opaque #111
    + the cassette skin gradient — no muddy-translucent problem, so no
    de-mud). Card text (.ak-archive-title #fff) is NOT recolored.
  - NO doodles in ARCH-1 (the deck is a full-viewport overflow:hidden
    surface and the arrows occupy the L/R gutters — deferred; if ever
    wanted, limit to the header/footer bands outside the deck).
  - NOT touched: sections/ak-archive.liquid (deck HTML/CSS/JS — spring
    physics, drag/tap, arrows, keyboard, the 18 data-href links, the inert
    particle guard, the cassette-case skin, deck geometry), sections/
    ak-top.liquid, sections/ak-footer.liquid, layout/theme.liquid, all
    other pages' snippets/templates, individual collection pages, products,
    cart, Mystery Box, assets, the live theme, the normal dev theme.

  HARD HAZARD — never add width / max-width / layout constraints to
  .ak-archive, .ak-archive-section, .ak-archive-stage, .ak-archive-card, or
  .ak-archive-card-inner, and never touch the section JS: the deck is a
  spring-physics drag surface that reads getBoundingClientRect; only paint
  (background / color / border / box-shadow) is touched here.

  Revert (whole Archive notebook host): in templates/list-collections.json
  delete the custom-liquid host section + its entry in `order` (restores the
  4-section dark Archive: main / ak-top / ak-archive / ak-footer), and delete
  this snippet. (Or git revert the "experiment: archive notebook paper"
  commit.) sections/ak-archive.liquid never changes either way.
  ============================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<script>
  /* Page hook — this snippet only renders behind the
     template contains 'list-collections' Liquid guard in
     templates/list-collections.json, so the class can be added
     unconditionally. */
  (function(){ document.documentElement.classList.add('ak-archive-page'); })();
</script>

<style>
  /* ============================================================
     ARCHIVE NOTEBOOK PAPER BACKDROP — CSS-only, scoped to
     .ak-archive-page. Same accepted values as the other notebook
     pages (shared --ak-paper-side-gap). html.ak-archive-page
     specificity is LOAD-BEARING: it must beat the global
     html,body{background:#000 !important} net in layout/theme.liquid.
     ============================================================ */
  html.ak-archive-page{
    --ak-paper-top-gap: clamp(150px, 17vw, 220px);    /* blank top band behind the KID logo / nav */
    --ak-paper-bottom-gap: clamp(130px, 12vw, 190px); /* blank bottom band — ruled lines fade out so the page doesn't end mid-line */
    --ak-purple:#ff33ff;                              /* official AmeriKid purple (any var(--ak-purple) consumer resolves official) */
    background:#f5dd4f !important;                    /* overscroll/canvas fallback — beats the global html #000 via specificity */
  }
  html.ak-archive-page body{
    --ak-paper-side-gap: clamp(82px, 7vw, 128px);     /* shared inset for both vertical rules (red left + blue right) */
    background-color:#f5dd4f !important;              /* pale legal-pad yellow */
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg,
        transparent calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap)),
        rgba(44,120,180,.60) calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap)),
        rgba(44,120,180,.60) calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px),
        transparent calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px)),   /* blue RIGHT margin rule */
      linear-gradient(90deg,
        transparent var(--ak-paper-side-gap),
        rgba(218,40,50,.74) var(--ak-paper-side-gap),
        rgba(218,40,50,.74) calc(var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px),
        transparent calc(var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px)),          /* red LEFT margin rule */
      linear-gradient(180deg,
        #f5dd4f 0,
        #f5dd4f var(--ak-paper-top-gap),
        transparent var(--ak-paper-top-gap)),                       /* blank yellow TOP band */
      linear-gradient(180deg,
        transparent calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-bottom-gap)),
        #f5dd4f calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-bottom-gap) + 36px)),     /* blank yellow BOTTOM band */
      repeating-linear-gradient(180deg,
        transparent 0 31px,
        rgba(44,120,180,.60) 31px 32px) !important;                 /* blue horizontal ruled lines */
    background-repeat:no-repeat, no-repeat, no-repeat, no-repeat, repeat !important;
    background-position:0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0 var(--ak-paper-top-gap) !important;
    background-attachment:scroll, scroll, scroll, scroll, scroll !important;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     TRANSPARENCY BACKSTOPS — let the body paper show through the page
     chrome AND behind the cassette deck.
     - #MainContent / .gradient / .shopify-section / .ak-top-wrap: the
       shared notebook backstops (without them the top reads as a black
       band, esp. on mobile).
     - .ak-archive-section: the deck's OUTER section wrapper (the schema
       "class": "ak-archive-section" paints it #000 to "kill white body bg
       bleed") -> transparent so the paper shows.
     - .ak-archive: the deck's INNER full-viewport stage (height:100vh;
       overflow:hidden; background:#000) -> PAINT-ONLY transparent. Only
       `background` is overridden — height / overflow / flex / padding are
       untouched, so the spring/drag/tap geometry is byte-identical.
     ============================================================ */
  .ak-archive-page #MainContent{ background:transparent !important; }
  .ak-archive-page #MainContent .gradient{ background:transparent !important; background-image:none !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .shopify-section{ background:transparent !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-archive-section{ background:transparent !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-archive{ background:transparent !important; }
  /* the inert (guard-disabled) particle canvas — hidden page-scoped; the
     element stays in the DOM so the section's getElementById still resolves
     and its early-return path is unchanged. */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-archive-canvas{ display:none !important; }

  /* ============================================================
     FONTS — Due Date display voice (duplicated scoped @font-face,
     the deliberate house pattern; same self-hosted asset as the
     other notebook pages). No Tenada: there is no '#' on this route.
     ============================================================ */
  @font-face{
    font-family: 'AK Due Date';
    src: url('{{ 'ak-due-date.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
    font-weight: normal;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     HEADER / NAV / CART — FULL notebook parity, ported from the
     accepted treatment (Club Hub Phase 3.9 mask-PNG nav lineage)
     and re-scoped to .ak-archive-page. ak-top.liquid is NOT edited.
     ARCHIVE (.ak-top-archive) is the active tile on /collections: it is a
     MASKED wordmark tile, so its purple #ff33ff + magenta glow comes from
     the shared .ak-top-tile.is-active::before rule below.
     ============================================================ */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-wrap{ background:transparent !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-wrap::after{ background:none !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-label{ color:#15120b !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-bad{ color:#15120b !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-mobile-trigger{ color:#15120b !important; text-shadow:none !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-label::before,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-label::after{ opacity:0 !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-tile:hover .ak-top-label,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-tile.is-active .ak-top-label,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-bad:hover,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-bad.is-active,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-mobile-trigger:hover{ color:#ff33ff !important; }
  /* cart: black ink at rest, magenta glow on hover/focus; small right nudge so the blue right rule isn't crowded */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-cart-container{ transform:translateX(clamp(4px, .6vw, 10px)) !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-cart-img{ filter:brightness(0) !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-cart-link:hover .ak-top-cart-img,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-cart-link:focus-visible .ak-top-cart-img{
    filter:brightness(0) drop-shadow(0 0 6px #ff33ff) drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255,51,255,.5)) !important;
  }
  /* tighten logo->nav spacing + remove the dark-theme glow divider */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-divider{ display:none !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-nav-panel{ padding-top:clamp(2px,0.6vw,8px) !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-nav-area{ margin-top:clamp(-22px,-2.2vw,-8px) !important; }
  /* per-tile mask + size + tilt (same PNGs / sizes / tilts as the accepted notebook nav) */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-life{    --ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/lifestyle_button.png?v=1780886497"); --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(260px, 21vw, 400px);   --ak-nav-tilt:-2.2deg; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-products{--ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/products_button.png?v=1780886497");  --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(280px, 23vw, 430px);   --ak-nav-tilt:1.4deg; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-archive{ --ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/archive_button.png?v=1780885375");   --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(270px, 22vw, 420px);   --ak-nav-tilt:-1.1deg; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-narrative{--ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/narrative_button.png?v=1780885375"); --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(265px, 21.5vw, 410px); --ak-nav-tilt:1.8deg; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-contact{ --ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/moniker_button.png?v=1780885375");   --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(220px, 18vw, 340px);   --ak-nav-tilt:-1.6deg; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-bad{ --ak-nav-tilt:-2.5deg; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-candy{ --ak-nav-tilt:1.2deg; }
  /* clickable tiles (all 7): no transform / bg-png / recolor-filter; transform excluded from transitions */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-life,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-products,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-archive,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-narrative,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-contact,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-bad,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-candy{
    transform:none !important; -webkit-transform:none !important;
    background-image:none !important; filter:none !important;
    transition-property:filter, color, opacity, background-color !important;
    will-change:auto !important;
  }
  /* the five wordmark masks live on ::before (holds the static tilt; overrides base .ak-top-tile::before{display:none}) */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-life::before,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-products::before,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-archive::before,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-narrative::before,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-contact::before{
    content:"" !important; display:block !important; position:absolute !important;
    left:50% !important; top:50% !important;
    width:var(--ak-nav-png-size) !important; height:var(--ak-nav-png-size) !important;
    transform:translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    -webkit-transform:translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    transform-origin:center center !important;
    backface-visibility:hidden !important; -webkit-backface-visibility:hidden !important;
    pointer-events:none !important;
    background-color:#15120b !important;
    -webkit-mask:var(--ak-nav-mask) center / contain no-repeat !important;
    mask:var(--ak-nav-mask) center / contain no-repeat !important;
    transition:background-color .12s ease, opacity .12s ease !important;
    z-index:1 !important;
  }
  /* hover / keyboard-focus / press -> the WHOLE wordmark turns purple (.is-active EXCLUDED — it has its own rule) */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-life:hover::before, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-life:focus-visible::before, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-life:active::before,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-products:hover::before, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-products:focus-visible::before, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-products:active::before,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-archive:hover::before, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-archive:focus-visible::before, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-archive:active::before,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-narrative:hover::before, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-narrative:focus-visible::before, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-narrative:active::before,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-contact:hover::before, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-contact:focus-visible::before, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-contact:active::before{
    background-color:#ff33ff !important;
  }
  /* ACTIVE wordmark cue — fires for the active masked tile. On /collections
     ARCHIVE (.ak-top-archive) is active -> its ::before paints official
     purple + magenta glow (the proven NARRATIVE-active mechanism). */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-tile.is-active::before{
    background-color:#ff33ff !important;
    filter:
      drop-shadow(0 0 4px #ff33ff)
      drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255,51,255,.75))
      drop-shadow(0 0 24px rgba(255,51,255,.5)) !important;
  }
  /* keep the five labels in the DOM for screen readers, but visually hidden in ALL states */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-life .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-life:hover .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-life:focus-visible .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-life:active .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-life.is-active .ak-top-label,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-products .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-products:hover .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-products:focus-visible .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-products:active .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-products.is-active .ak-top-label,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-archive .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-archive:hover .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-archive:focus-visible .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-archive:active .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-archive.is-active .ak-top-label,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-narrative .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-narrative:hover .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-narrative:focus-visible .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-narrative:active .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-narrative.is-active .ak-top-label,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-contact .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-contact:hover .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-contact:focus-visible .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-contact:active .ak-top-label, .ak-archive-page .ak-top-contact.is-active .ak-top-label{
    color:transparent !important; text-shadow:none !important;
  }
  /* BAD / CANDY: tilt+scale on the inner graphic, anchor stays transform-stable (sizes BAD 1.18, CANDY 1.75) */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-bad-mask{
    transform:scale(1.18) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    -webkit-transform:scale(1.18) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
  }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-top-candy-img{
    transform:scale(1.75) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    -webkit-transform:scale(1.75) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     ARCHIVE ARROWS — paint-only ink chips. The base arrows are a
     near-transparent dark circle (background:rgba(0,0,0,.45)) with a
     white chevron, designed for a #000 deck; over the yellow paper the
     base HOVER state (background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)) would wash the
     white chevron out. Force an ink-tinted dark chip in rest AND hover
     so the white chevron keeps high contrast on paper, with a purple
     hover border to match the notebook accent. ONLY paint is touched —
     position / size / z-index / transform (the click targets and the
     translateY centering) are NOT touched.
     ============================================================ */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-archive-prev,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-archive-next{
    background:rgba(21,18,11,0.62) !important;
    border-color:rgba(21,18,11,0.30) !important;
  }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-archive-prev:hover,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-archive-next:hover{
    background:rgba(21,18,11,0.78) !important;
    border-color:#ff33ff !important;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     FOOTER INTEGRATION — paper shows behind the footer, ink
     back-to-top, Due Date CTA. ak-footer.liquid is NOT edited.
     ============================================================ */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-footer{ background:transparent !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-btt{ color:#15120b !important; }                     /* .ak-btt-text inherits */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-footer-copy{ color:rgba(21,18,11,.5) !important; }
  .ak-archive-page .ak-btt:hover .ak-btt-text,
  .ak-archive-page .ak-btt:focus-visible .ak-btt-text{ color:#ff33ff !important; } /* preserve purple hover/focus */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-footer-rule{ background:none !important; }           /* remove footer glow line (keep spacing) */
  .ak-archive-page .ak-btt-text{ font-family:'AK Due Date', Impact, Haettenschweiler, 'Arial Narrow Bold', sans-serif !important; }
</style>
